  "changes": [
    "Only two existing eligible defensive Space sites route through the bounded alignment helper.",
    "At most3 actual direction-key wait requests<=60ms each; current player angle is read, never assigned.",
    "Final target is the same currently visible opponent, within original<=37 or<40px, error<=25degrees and not windup/strike; thresholds preserve original health/risk requirements.",
    "Report/JSONL facingChecks exactly match, including turn inputs and Space evidence, actual whole clock, releases and errors.",
    "Directional request180ms is not claimed to bound total actual key-held time; whole check+Space+cleanup is<=1000ms actual game time.",
    "Original policy15 and signed16 are unchanged; old missing strike checks outside this narrow melee permission remain as originally frozen.",
    "V2 only corrects the wrapper integration: policy17 controller/journey validators, its frozen guard dependency, and the actual per-case/per-grade original journey.jsonl event array as the fifth argument. Other four candidate code files remain byte-identical to V1."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No browser has run this policy; boundary pass is not game qualification or hit evidence.",
    "Angle normalization is10 decimal places to remove floating error at the mathematical25 degree edge.",
    "Outer original navigation/return policy and its cached observed return-budget estimate remain; no prediction of hidden attacks, future pressure or enemy damage."
